  "e2ba3a33-7a4e-451a-ac46-96927ebdcae2"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "draws a transverse light clock carried by the observer of velocity ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ", with ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " bounces between the observer and a mirror.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"754855d0-2bd9-4b60-871e-58488226158b"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
